SetVar *result evaluate(None)

GetTableElement nid of API_PARAMS
SetVar *arg_note_id LASTRESULT

SetVar *arg_note API_DATA

GetTableElement username of API_TOKEN
SetVar *arg_author LASTRESULT

execute app/scripts/db/updateNote.gcs

SetVar *result *json

evaluate {*arg_author} + 'updated a note on task:' + {*arg_task_id} =>*log_text
execute app/scripts/system/writeLog.gcs

end
